  "description": "Maximum dissipation with slow, wide solitons — the waves are losing energy faster than they travel, leaving only memory of their shape by the time you hear them. The bathypelagic zone: no light penetrates here, only pressure and the distant echo of surface events. Observe mode co-moving, chasing something already gone.",
